        "n": "A Month of Sundays w/ Bill Spencer",
        "s": "2026-11-22T17:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-22T18:00:00Z",
        "d": "Bill Spencer shares weekend recordings from his living room studio in Detroit, Michigan, from where he brings a range of soulful jazz rock, and ambient sounds, spanning to electronica and psychedelic dub.",
